# What `COPY . .` must never see. The images are public, so a local .env copied in would
# publish its secrets; the server passes them in at runtime instead. The rest is either
# rebuilt inside the image (node_modules, .nuxt, .output) or not needed to build it.
.env
.env.*
.git
.github
.claude
node_modules
.nuxt
.nitro
.output
.data
.cache
dist
docs
deploy
*.md
*.log
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
